        "problem": "$6$ is a composite number **and** $2$ is negative.\n\nConsider the compound statement above and the following notations:\n\n- $R:6\\text{\u00a0is a composite number}$\n\n- $S:2\\text{\u00a0is negative}$\n\nExpressed in symbolic form, our statement can be written as\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}{{field-3}}.",
